crop, a computation, several files along a dimension, a changed CRS) is
read into memory with \code{\link[stars:st_as_stars]{stars::st_as_stars()}} and drawn as an in-memory
object is, as a computed or cropped \code{SpatRaster} goes to a temporary
COG. A proxy over a colour COG (3 or 4 Byte bands with red, green, blue
